[[Halbrik]] is a [[skill trainer]] in [[Ascalon (pre-Searing)|pre-Searing]] [[Ascalon City (pre-Searing)|Ascalon City]]. Unlike other skill trainers, he only teaches [[List of Ascalon (pre-Searing) skills|skills that are also obtainable through pre-Searing quests]] (even if you have other [[Core]] or Prophecies skills [[unlock]]ed on your account) to [[character]]s that are at least [[level]] 10.

