== Dialogue ==
; Before reaching level 10
: ''"My services are reserved for those who serve the [[Ascalon Vanguard]]. Once you have proven your ability to '''[[Lieutenant Langmar]]''', I would be happy to assist you in learning new skills."''

== Notes ==
*This NPC is the only method in pre-Searing to acquire the remaining skills of your secondary [[profession]] (for example, Flare if you have chosen Elementalist as secondary) that a primary profession character would have earned by doing the appropriate <profession> Test quest.

== Trivia ==
*This [[NPC]] was added in the [[Feedback:Game updates/20110303|March 3, 2011 update]] and is named after [[Zack Nickerson]]'s main character "Halbrik Elvenstride".

